    <div class="track-grid"><article class="track"><span class="badge">PRIVATE GAME WORKSPACE</span><h3>From the season to the exact forecast.</h3><p>Open the private report for winner, home probability, projected scores, margin, total and cover / push / loss. Filter by season, week, gender, model version, stream, numeric result and missing capability. Detailed games retain all supplied versions.</p><p><a href="https://alvaro-ncaa-research-review.alv-mendizabal.chatgpt.site/private-report/index.html">Open the season workspace →</a></p><p class="table-note">Your local report stays in your browser. Public pages contain aggregate evidence and generic examples only.</p></article><article class="track"><span class="badge">EXPLICIT COVERAGE</span><h3>Missing fields have a recovery action.</h3><p id="b046-panels"></p><p class="table-note">The source-game denominator includes unmatched official candidates and retained versions. It is not certified as the complete physical schedule. An unqualified line cannot supply a cover probability; a completed flag cannot supply numeric final scores.</p></article></div>
