    <p class="table-note" id="b046-journal-summary"></p><div class="data-scroll"><table><caption>B046 current-season winner comparison · identical pairwise games · T−60 reconstruction</caption><thead><tr><th>Provider / product</th><th>Eligible games</th><th>Model / provider accuracy</th><th>Model / provider log loss</th><th>Model / provider Brier</th><th>Coverage state</th></tr></thead><tbody id="b046-provider-table"></tbody></table></div><p class="table-note">Polymarket international and US remain separate. Paired score differences are descriptive; the earlier 161, 129 and 122-game source versions remain dated. Higher pick accuracy can coexist with worse probability scores. No general superiority follows.</p><p class="table-note" id="b046-source-coverage"></p><p class="table-note">Different targets can have different eligibility. Model/version rows are not independent games. Current results cannot choose a new champion. The historical objective leaders below retain their earlier fixed selections.</p></section>
